  {
   "book": 6,
   "row": 74,
   "sec": 8,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **Naegleria fowleri habitat:** a free-living amoeba that thrives in warm freshwater and soil, tolerating temperatures up to about 46°C."
  },
  {
   "book": 6,
   "row": 75,
   "sec": 0,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **Gaganyaan basics:** designed to carry a crew of three to a 400 km orbit for a three-day mission; ISRO's second Integrated Air Drop Test (IADT-02, 10 April 2026, Sriharikota) validated the crew module's parachutes ahead of the uncrewed G1 flight."
  },
  {
   "book": 6,
   "row": 75,
   "sec": 5,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **Qdenga:** tetravalent dengue vaccine made by Takeda (Japan)."
